      "default": "",
      "x-ts-type": "string",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "`client_presence`: the reconcile stage this client last failed at (`get_state`, `history`, `replay`). Rides the beat the client already sends, so where a stuck conversation died reaches the machine without a new command or connection. Absent (or empty) means \"nothing to report\", which is what a healthy client and an older client both say."
    },
